{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想記錄兼職班次與加班時數，又不想依靠試算表或僱主提供的系統？WorkHours Log Timesheet OT Pay 專為時薪工作者、自由工作者及兼職接案者而設，讓你在手機上同時管理多份工作，建立清晰的工時記錄。程式原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>多份工作工時薪酬一目瞭然</h2>\n<p>程式支援打卡計時與手動輸入記錄方式，並可為每份工作設定獨立時薪，加班時數一併計算。內置工作日誌及輪班時間表，方便整理零散班次。收入統計涵蓋每週、每月與每年，結算薪酬一目瞭然。資料離線儲存於本機，無需註冊，並支援匯入匯出備份及貨幣設定，適合兼職、零售與合約工作。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-693-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-694-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-695-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-696-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-697-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：WorkHours Log Timesheet OT Pay</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T03:19:26.357307+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":342,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}